<title>USA: Net Telecomms buys Sierra Internet.</title>
<headline>Net Telecomms buys Sierra Internet.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS, Nev. 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net Telecommunications Inc said it would merge with Sierra Internet Inc.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement late on Monday that Sierra Internet would become a wholly owned subsidiary of Net Telecommunications.</p>
<p>Shareholders of Sierra Internet, a full-service Internet access provider, will receive stock from Net Telecommunications. Other terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>	  -- New York newsroom, (212) 859-1610</p>
